3. Datasets
-----------
`datasets/dev.jsonl` and `datasets/heldout.jsonl` were written for this project
(rubric-style prompts in Roman Hinglish, Devanagari and mixed Hindi-English). They
contain no text copied from an external benchmark; facts used in the `factuality`
category are common-knowledge statements, and the rubric tokens are our own.
